00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:33.090
So this is a simple class.

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:37.060
And we have our
processing function, here,

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:39.570
which is called helloWorld.

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:43.380
It takes a request parameter,
HttpServletRequest, as well as

